#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: payment-gateway-pix-for-givewp.php
msgid "Payment Gateway Pix for GiveWP"
msgstr "Payment Gateway Pix for GiveWP"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: payment-gateway-pix-for-givewp.php
msgid "https://www.linknacional.com.br/wordpress/givewp/"
msgstr "https://www.linknacional.com.br/wordpress/givewp/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: payment-gateway-pix-for-givewp.php
msgid ""
"Streamline your donation process and expand your reach to Brazilian donors "
"by integrating PIX, the instant payment system, into your GiveWP donation "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"Simplifique o processo de doação e amplie seu alcance para doadores "
"brasileiros integrando o PIX, o sistema de pagamento instantâneo, aos seus "
"formulários de doação do GiveWP."

